Owner: trials-efficacy-intelligence
Purpose: methodology notes — trial design/population extraction protocol, how the Level 1
(LDL efficacy) / Level 2 (combination-strategy CV outcome) / Level 3 (pitavastatin/ezetimibe
hard-outcome) evidence framework is applied, and population-comparability caveats when a cited
trial used a different statin (e.g., RACING = rosuvastatin, not pitavastatin).
